// What each facility level allows, per location. Card names are the CardKind names
// from src/card.rs.
//
//   card_levels: the highest level each card can be at that facility level.
//   card_limits: the most copies of each card that can go in one deck.
//   recipe_unlocks: the recipes that unlock at each facility level. Names must match
//                   recipes.ron exactly. A recipe that isn't listed counts as unlocked.
//
// 0 means the card isn't unlocked yet at that facility level. A facility level that
// isn't listed, or a card that isn't listed for a level, has no known cap, so the
// inventory's own values are used as they are.
//
// Every recipe is under level 1 until its real unlock level is known.
//
// Levels 1-11 (card_levels) and 1-10 (card_limits) are from @MatsuTaku's
// AFK Journey Techcard Optimizer.
//
// Data comes from community spreadsheet information found at
//https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vTkwoy0_IKEWZZWoCebVXn3zNEVOGbAvTdtn4d1tznfqT5n9SdnKM0oIIo6fCDFV2SharTIEnOx91v3/pubhtml#gid=1457088014
